// Privileged User Has Been Created | T1098, T1136.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/linux/builtin/lnx_privileged_user_creation.yml
*new\ user* AND (*GID\=0,* OR *UID\=0,* OR *GID\=10,* OR *GID\=27,*)

